[{"title":"送僧","author":"释月涧","text":"摘杨花，摘杨花，唵摩尼吽㗶吒。\n便恁么会已是错，不恁么会尤更差。\n一回撞著无面目老骨檛，方知元不在天涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34835,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送圆侍者","author":"释月涧","text":"香林侍云门，阅十八寒暑。\n刚把野狐涎，涴却所衣褚。\n汝侍吾笔砚，我元无一语。\n乃以羊角峰，蘸竭东湖水。\n学本无止法，犹海深无底。\n斥鴳从卑飞，大鹏九万里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34836,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送付藏主","author":"释月涧","text":"老我无堪涉世艰，鬓毛新糁雪霜斑。\n有人来自庐山中，眼如点漆音如钟。\n衔袖出新卷，两眼惊且眩。\n方知亲自香溪哥室来，老婆心切言诙诙。\n三世诸佛一口吞，一大藏教彻底翻。\n丛林乡社有此俊迈之英才，我辈可老可死无馀怀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34837,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"印月","author":"释月涧","text":"性海湛如，心月皎如。\n水与月融，月与水摄。\n水月交光，印文呈露。\n山河大地，万象森罗。\n一印印定，虚彻洞明。\n廓兮烱兮，以證来观。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34838,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送福上人","author":"释月涧","text":"禅欲参兮道欲学，莫负娘生一双脚。\n培塿不足登，蹄涔应易涸。\n观水须观百千溟渤之钜海，登山须登万丈嵩华之乔岳。\n高高高无极，深深深无底。\n一回见得亲，冥鸿千万里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34839,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正秀行脚","author":"释月涧","text":"长老小师不参禅，只为寻常见得惯。\n汝今别我要行脚，与汝谩说个公案。\n我亦黄龙长老儿，少年发志大犹低。\n一筇行遍半天下，要勘诸方老古锥。\n发足仍发勇猛志，莫把参禅当容易。\n只今诸老若晨星，半人所在亦须至。\n山僧年老已心孤，那堪送汝更写偈。\n出门步步好为人，九万里程一鹏翅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34840,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"进无止","author":"释月涧","text":"灼然大道如大海，浩无涯涘深无底。\n摐摐万有资之生，生生不已由兹始。\n饮者大小随所量，随量满足皆厌喜。\n有人直欲探其源，得其源矣进无止。\n若从涓滴识全潮，方信万波元一水。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34841,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"达此宗","author":"释月涧","text":"若论此道若须弥，根四部洲高无极。\n日月循环无昼夜，毗岚纵作无变易。\n欲达此宗须造颠，遍参闽楚几山碧。\n一回见得亲，万叠巍峨只卷石。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34842,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雕匠羌若正","author":"释月涧","text":"古汗有敏匠，能作诸佛像。\n有相皆是妄，无相之中有真相。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34843,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"德详大师礼补陀五台","author":"释月涧","text":"五台峨峨五云里，补陀峨峨东海底。\n大士元不在其中，误赚平人知几几。\n江南吴越诸导师，短偈长篇费言语。\n老僧有语写不得，一再殷勤奉劝汝。\n若论观音与曼殊，尽恒沙界无不是。\n灼然端的要见渠，不用千里与万里。\n只消著眼未生前，面目堂堂即自己。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34844,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹隐","author":"释月涧","text":"香严去沩阜，欲南阳种竹。\n片瓦太无端，等闲相击触。\n累及忘所知，嘉名受污辱。\n有人今效尤，千顷种寒玉。\n澹然冰霜中，岁晚乐幽独。\n慎勿轻击著，清风自然足。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34845,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送善禅人","author":"释月涧","text":"学道如牧牛，寻牛须访迹。\n牛既已纯熟，牧乃便省力。\n靠壁旧乌藤，一朝生两翼。\n天地岂不大，去当六月息。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34846,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送瑊侍者","author":"释月涧","text":"有佛处不得住，斗门硬闸。\n无佛处急走过，拦江铁网。\n赵州立者两重关，致使学者欲去被去碍，欲住被住碍。\n无自由分，伶利衲僧。\n拶得透，跳得出，方为庆快。\n虽然，更须知五里单牌，十里双堠始得。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34847,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧","author":"释月涧","text":"勇猛发心要行脚，莫把光阴空费却。\n青山绿水眼中尘，梵语唐言皆毒药。\n瞥转机先亲见彻，万里秋空飞一鹗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34848,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渊侍者归天童西岩和尚塔所","author":"释月涧","text":"堂堂幻智翁，为宋钜魔孽。\n我昔误见之，痛棒打得折。\n冷地蓦思量，有屈无处雪。\n渊也长庚来，言僒曾不灭。\n幻出窣堵波，黄金充一国。\n村草步头草，香风春茁茁。\n有语远寄将，捻鼻消一咄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34849,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送竺源合侍者","author":"释月涧","text":"佛道实幽远，未易可窥测。\n著眼朕非先，犹鬲恒沙国。\n一切俱放下，百不会不知。\n只在鼻笑头，元不鬲丝厘。\n吾道今如何，秋风落叶多。\n满手握春风，吹醒冰霜柯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34850,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送则自然书记","author":"释月涧","text":"老来不写送行语，送子不可无一句。\n几回特地费思量，有句可写难写意。\n从上佛与祖，别无可指示。\n只要息心仍息念，墙壁木偶恰相似。\n蓦然见得亲，不负出家志。\n茫茫日月去如飞，转得眼来老已至。\n当思祖道重千钧，凛如一发孰可寄。\n钓雪矶头瞠老眼，秋空万里孤鸿远。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34851,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送舜禅往庐山","author":"释月涧","text":"行脚须具行脚眼，当以前辈为标格。\n近来丛席说庐山，禅子竞趋不吴越。\n汝今直往虎侯溪，一香三拜依位立。\n棒如雨点打将来，当下知归方是行脚事云毕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34852,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宗藏主之吴越","author":"释月涧","text":"袅袅春风软，点点春山远。\n如来禅与祖师意，满眼满耳无不是。\n短筇拨著南北峰，钱塘万顷寒涛舂。\n一笑归去来，云中五老笑颜开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34853,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送昙昱侄礼拜净慈愚极老叔","author":"释月涧","text":"汝今别我去行脚，听我殷勤重告汝。\n人身难得今已得，直须著意明自己。\n只今丛林未寂寥，四海一翁老愚叔。\n惠日峰前九拜时，照顾粗拳当面筑。\n白发盈颠七十翁，期汝有成志超越。\n为报江海几故人，晚年富贵一矶雪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34854,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送辨藏主","author":"释月涧","text":"老眼正昏明，喜见哥宁馨。\n吐语■璆玕，秀发禅林英。\n斯道犹大厦，颓焉欲倾陀。\n独支期敏手，毋擅立壑美。\n大鹏一举九万里。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34855,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"珍维那归径山就简虎岩和尚","author":"释月涧","text":"水云相望楚与吴，三年不作问安书。\n英英禅子来岩边，为我细说岩平安。\n但言倒握无形棒，若佛若祖难近傍。\n烦寄一语休拍盲，本来无佛无众生。\n不妨借取腕头力，永为大地人知识。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34856,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"礼仗锡巳禅师塔","author":"释月涧","text":"吞却七峰无寸土，灼然无地著尸骸。\n不知当日谁闲管，刚把虚空掘窖埋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34857,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"礼思大禅师塔","author":"释月涧","text":"岿然七十二峰秀，灵骨温温色尚新。\n我若等闲开坐具，阿师无地著浑身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34858,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"礼杨岐禅师塔","author":"释月涧","text":"正脉如今一线微，不堪惆怅泪交颐。\n冷云深没楚山顶，全体当年缩项时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34859,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼霍山","author":"释月涧","text":"老倒霍山无赖吒，妙高峰顶恣抛沙。\n大开死口凌霄上，又是一番重退牙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34860,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"懒瓒岩","author":"释月涧","text":"天子亲颁字十行，难徵老子起岩房。\n只将牛粪星儿火，煨得蹲鸱万古香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34861,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石屏塔","author":"释月涧","text":"曾分定石竺峰前，回首秋风三十年。\n漠漠吴天自空阔，老猿和雨哭苍烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34862,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石林塔","author":"释月涧","text":"云寒窣堵玉棱层，自酹西湖一勺清。\n老舌炽然无慈在，钱塘潮撼宋王城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34863,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"礼黄龙先师塔","author":"释月涧","text":"钝锹搅动苍龙窟，浪激波腾海岳昏。\n一笑不知深问讯，先师灵骨俨然存。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34864,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浙中象外诸友寄新作","author":"释月涧","text":"肝胆重重楚越分，别来不愿见诸君。\n那知熟血重相喷，涴却三千里水云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34865,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀径山诸友","author":"释月涧","text":"十年交结几冤憎，别后谁能记姓名。\n遥想瞎驴成大队，挹南岳又望东溟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34866,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢无文惠书不至","author":"释月涧","text":"一幅无文倍息全，无端流落水云边。\n秋空雁字重书出，顿首分明到不宣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34867,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"田叟","author":"释月涧","text":"半亩春风个钁头，通身泥水不曾休。\n布成荆棘参天了，老子今年大有秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34868,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"斗山","author":"释月涧","text":"四角量来四极同，乾坤大地在其中。\n虾儿没兴跳得出，冲破□须百万重。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34869,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺庐山罗汉老子","author":"释月涧","text":"说法声如动地雷，小南铺席又重开。\n成群引得呆尊者，远远也从高丽来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34870,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼无文和尚","author":"释月涧","text":"玉几深深结死冤，错传一印漫无文。\n春雷轰破轰不破，尽尽江天飞暮云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34871,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉崖朝京归住天池","author":"释月涧","text":"天上明光四度登，古今屈措几人曾。\n放光近向庐山顶，莫谓文殊夜放灯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34872,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送仁侄","author":"释月涧","text":"恶业相从十五年，未尝蹉口教参禅。\n而今年老心孤甚，三十乌藤趁上船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34873,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南侍者往送乃师朝京","author":"释月涧","text":"阿师北去朝金阙，款语丁宁子一回。\n京洛春风无限好，我宽襟袖裹将来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34874,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"法相习兄小室在黄金山下","author":"释月涧","text":"人间万事不如闲，湖海归来紧著关。\n自笑一生贫不尽，黄金推作屋头山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34875,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄和寅知客来韵","author":"释月涧","text":"老来怀抱转难平，棒下全无舐犊情。\n尚有一分慈悯处，教人只向棘中行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34876,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"万杉东源和尚塔","author":"释月涧","text":"活葬东风百草源，只因错会祖师禅。\n十千古木匡庐顶，一一枝头啼杜鹃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34877,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧归金陵白莲庵","author":"释月涧","text":"石头城里屋三椽，满屋清香是白莲。\n皎洁一心何所似，夜深淮水月初圆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34878,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"摘茶","author":"释月涧","text":"拚双赤手入丛林，要觅春风一寸心。\n但觉爪牙归掌握，不知烟雾湿衣襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34879,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莲社题经荐孤魂","author":"释月涧","text":"一卷百千万亿卷，普使幽冥趋净方。\n越水东边明月夜，白莲朵朵晋时香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34880,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠发匠","author":"释月涧","text":"年来顿觉发如丝，多少傍人笑老痴。\n妙手不须频摘剃，几人得到白头时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34881,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"多宝寺","author":"释月涧","text":"千涧碧流寒漱玉，万山黄叶冷摇金。\n若言即此见多宝，猿叫岳云深更深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34882,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罗汉浮杯图","author":"释月涧","text":"神通妙用无些子，踏破沧溟几处潮。\n个个脚跟学逼逼，老僧无暇举藤条。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34883,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"血书金刚经","author":"释月涧","text":"娘生指上血一滴，染尽给孤园里花。\n三十二枝春盎盎，不知香蔼几恒沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34884,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天童四威仪 其一","author":"释月涧","text":"行，无端失脚堕深坑。\n转得步，笑倒更幽亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34885,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天童四威仪 其二","author":"释月涧","text":"住，一身贫到无贫处。\n有谁知，狎鸥并宿鹭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34886,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天童四威仪 其三","author":"释月涧","text":"坐，却被蒲团先识破。\n松作声，元是微风过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34887,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天童四威仪 其四","author":"释月涧","text":"卧，太白一峰枕头大。\n伸双脚，虚空俱踏破。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34888,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁侍者往浙","author":"释月涧","text":"痛把山藤手自鞭，衔冤又上浙江船。\n东湖佛法无多子，莫打诸方肋下拳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34889,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送屷侍者见雪岩","author":"释月涧","text":"仰山作梦梦未醒，噡语如今转更乔。\n识得渠侬穷伎俩，跨门先倒用藤条。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34890,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送富侍者入京","author":"释月涧","text":"灼然要敌王公富，挨到无锥卓地时。\n万里秋空双眼豁，不知身在御楼西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34891,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠弋阳剪剃祝咏","author":"释月涧","text":"端的洪炉百炼钢，双收双放凛寒霜。\n这些柄把捻得定，要截诸方短与长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34892,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"定山","author":"释月涧","text":"诸缘外息心无喘，堕在那伽那一机。\n蹉口一回轻噫欠，疾雷轰破五须弥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34893,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北海","author":"释月涧","text":"谩将折箸探源流，直到俱卢穷尽头。\n端的这回亲见彻，百千溟渤一浮沤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34894,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送琇上人","author":"释月涧","text":"楖栗横肩犯晓寒，倚天青即是庐山。\n上人幸有娘生脚，直到高高顶?间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34895,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"掬月","author":"释月涧","text":"等闲?取娘生手，万浪中间搅一回。\n拶得清波无透路，玉蟾辊入掌中来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34896,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅山","author":"释月涧","text":"午夜寒香汎翠微，横斜影里立孤危。\n看他垂手为人处，放下悬屋第一枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34897,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄呈西岩和尚","author":"释月涧","text":"玲珑岩下忆辞师，软语丁宁归莫迟。\n昨夜春堂轰霹雳，分明一喝再参时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34898,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖东庙化元霄","author":"释月涧","text":"楼台鬲岸沸笙箫，万斛金莲撒碧霄。\n湖水东边杨柳树，也开青眼看元霄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34899,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送逊禅人","author":"释月涧","text":"楚天空阔雁横秋，扬示二千年话头。\n闪电光中如不荐，满蓬烟雨上孤舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34900,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠刀镊","author":"释月涧","text":"如星囧囧瞭双眸，妙处工夫少与俦。\n捏定这些真柄霸，衲僧那个不低头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34901,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送恢侍者","author":"释月涧","text":"觅安心法没来由，呆立庭前雪到腰。\n祇好别行条活路，看庐山看浙江潮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34902,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无相和尚塔","author":"释月涧","text":"怒霆轰耳记曾呼，充塞乾坤恨未除。\n将谓阿师无实相，春风万叠峙康庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34903,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天池资胜庵","author":"释月涧","text":"万个筼筜带雪青，一庵犹自揭唐名。\n道人心欲留云住，宽著俨问屋数楹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34904,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天池半云亭","author":"释月涧","text":"脚头步步蹑云梯，到此须知恰半之。\n绝顶欲观天地阔，不妨款款策藤枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34905,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄保寿心镜","author":"释月涧","text":"保寿当年不渡河，个般檐板误人多。\n劝君剩买草鞋好，弹雀何曾只就窠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34906,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"枯山","author":"释月涧","text":"点点寒飙振槁枝，翠微重叠冻云垂。\n春风万斛呼不醒，别嶂一声啼子规。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34907,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]